<p>Hi <%= @recipient_name %>,</p>

<p>New documents have been issued to you in the iQs Jobs portal.</p>

<p>
  <strong>Project:</strong> <%= @project.code.presence || "Project ##{@project.id}" %><br>
  <strong>Title:</strong> <%= @project_issue.title %><br>
  <strong>Description:</strong> <%= @project_issue.description.presence || "Not supplied" %>
</p>

<p style="margin-bottom: 0;">Message:</p>
<div style="margin-top: 0;">
  <%= simple_format(@project_issue.body.presence || "No message supplied.", {}, wrapper_tag: "div") %>
</div>

<p><strong>Attachments:</strong> <%= pluralize(@project_issue.documents.count, "file") %> available</p>

<p><%= link_to "Log in to download the documents", issued_document_url(@project_issue) %></p>

<p>Thanks,<br>The iQs Team</p>

<p style="margin-top: 32px; margin-bottom: 4px; font-style: italic;">
  Quantity surveying and estimating grounded in real construction experience.
</p>

<p style="margin-top: 0; color: #2f7faa; font-style: italic;">
  <strong>NOTICE:</strong> This message from CD Group contains privileged and confidential information intended only for the use of the addressee named above. If you are not the intended recipient of this message, you are hereby notified that you must not disseminate, copy, or take any action in reliance on it. If you have received this message in error, please notify CD Group immediately.
</p>
